<title>JAPAN: BOT-M'bishi up after rising in London.</title>
<headline>BOT-M'bishi up after rising in London.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Bank of Tokyo-Mitsubishi Ltd were higher in mid-morning trade on Wednesday after they rose overnight in London, brokers said.</p>
<p>At 0051 GMT, the shares were 50 yen higher at 2,320 yen with a 1.585 million trade volume.</p>
</text>
